---
---

<section class="accelerating">
  <div class="accelerating__blob"></div>

  <div class="container accelerating__inner" data-reveal>
    <div class="accelerating__stat">
      <span class="accelerating__stat-number">25+</span>
      <span class="accelerating__stat-label">Years of network operator experience</span>
    </div>

    <div class="accelerating__copy">
      <span class="eyebrow">Accelerating Productivity</span>
      <p class="accelerating__statement">
        CHIME is the 'industry first' application for network operators, designed to improve field
        force productivity while addressing the industry-wide challenge of increasing regulatory
        volumes.
      </p>
      <p class="accelerating__body">
        With over 25 years of experience and a dedicated focus on network operators since 2014, we
        understand the industry challenges, and ensure every aspect of CHiME is designed to meet
        these unique challenges.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .accelerating {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--color-blue-deep), var(--color-blue-mid) 130%);
    color: var(--color-white);
  }

  /* Same scrim recipe as EnquireCta's gradient band: the lighter end alone
     only gives white text ~2.7:1 contrast, under the 4.5:1 AA minimum. */
  .accelerating::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 0;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
  }

  .accelerating__blob {
    position: absolute;
    left: -7.5rem;
    bottom: -10rem;
    width: 28.75rem;
    height: 28.75rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 70%);
  }

  .accelerating__inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 3.5rem;
    padding-block: 7.5rem;
  }

  .accelerating__stat {
    flex: 0 0 14rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .accelerating__stat-number {
    font-size: 4.5rem;
    line-height: 1;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-white);
  }

  .accelerating__stat-label {
    max-width: 12rem;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
  }

  .accelerating__copy {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    max-width: 42rem;
  }

  .accelerating .eyebrow {
    color: var(--color-blue-pale);
  }

  .accelerating__statement {
    font-size: 1.875rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-white);
  }

  .accelerating__body {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .accelerating__inner {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
  }
</style>
